  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing LeadPilot\'s Homepage**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting LeadPilot\'s homepage. It needs to clearly communicate CRM software for SMEs with strong emphasis on lead generation and automation. I\'m considering visual hierarchy and user flow to ensure an intuitive and engaging experience, making sure it addresses the pain points of that demographic.\n\n\n**Defining LeadPilot\'s Focus**\n\nI\'ve clarified the core value proposition: AI-powered sales CRM for B2B SMEs with automated next-step assignments. My focus is now on the target audience (Vertriebsleiter-Volker), considering features like central lead capture, AI lead scoring, and pipeline dashboards. I\'m also factoring in the German language and GDPR compliance, plus the teal/cyan and orange brand colors.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now honing the visual aesthetic. I\'m leaning toward a professional SaaS look, avoiding overly bright gradients or generic design tropes. I\'m considering using `#FF8800` or `#FF5722` as accent colors on a dark background, if that works, or just those colors. The \"anti-slop\" approach is crucial: clean layouts and no nested cards.\n\n**Developing Content Strategy**\n\nMy focus is the content strategy. The German headline will be: \"Wir helfen Vertriebsleitern im B2B-Mittelstand dabei, keine Leads mehr zu verlieren, indem wir mit LeadPilot jedem Lead automatisch den n\303\244chsten f\303\244lligen Schritt zuweisen, sodass ihr Team mehr Abschl\303\274sse erzielt.\" I\'m also planning a single-page marketing site for LeadPilot, with key sections for header/navigation, a hero section, and more.\n\n\n**Outlining Landing Page Sections**\n\nI\'m now outlining sections. I\'ll need a clear call to action (CTA): \"14 Tage kostenlos testen\" and \"Produktdemo ansehen.\" I\'ll also add a dashboard mockup. The problem is \"Up to 70% of leads are never contacted.\" This is due to Excel chaos and manual reporting. Features will be automatic assignment, AI lead scoring, quick setup, and GDPR compliance. I\'m targeting machine building, IT, wholesale, and agencies with 0-200 employees. I\'m setting pricing: Starter, Growth, and Pro. I\'ll need footer links. I will build it with Tailwind CSS.\n\n\n**Structuring the Project**\n\nI\'m now focusing on project architecture. I\'ve decided on `index.html` as is, `src/App.tsx` for the landing page. I\'m using `lucide-react` for icons, aiming for a purely CSS/Lucide-based UI to avoid image path complications. I\'m starting to define the clean UI within `src/App.tsx`. I have `lucide-react`, `motion`, and `tailwindcss` as dependencies.\n\n\n**Implementing UI and Copy**\n\nI\'m now implementing the UI with Tailwind CSS and `lucide-react` icons, focusing on the color palette: teal, orange, and off-white/slate. I\'ve translated the copy for the hero section: \"Kein Lead wird mehr vergessen. Mehr Abschl\303\274sse f\303\274r Ihr Team.\" and subhead: \"Das KI-gest\303\274tzte Sales-CRM f\303\274r den B2B-Mittelstand. LeadPilot weist jedem Kontakt automatisch den n\303\244chsten f\303\244lligen Schritt zu \342\200\223 damit Ihr Vertrieb organisiert bleibt.\" I\'m including CTAs \"14 Tage kostenlos testen.\" I\'m working on the pain points and feature sections.\n\n\n**Organizing Landing Page Structure**\n\nI\'m now organizing the page sections, including the feature sections with pipeline dashboards. Pricing will be included (Starter, Growth, Pro), with Starter at 49 \342\202\254/month. The GDPR compliance is essential (hosting in Germany/Europe). I\'ll modularize the components into separate files: Header, Hero, ProblemSection, Features, Pricing, and Footer. I\'ve also named the app \"LeadPilot\" in the metadata. I\'m focusing on responsiveness and elegance.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 12
      nanos: 211946332
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
