  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F9F8F6] text-[#1A1A1A] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative border-8 border-white box-border\\\">\\n  <!-- Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end p-10 h-24 border-b border-[#1A1A1A]/10\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic\\\">LeadPilot.</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-12 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Software</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Features</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">KMU-Fokus</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"border-b border-[#1A1A1A] pb-1\\\">Kontakt</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Hero -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-8 p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-8 font-semibold text-[#1A1A1A]/50\\\">Automatisierte Lead-Generierung</h2>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-[110px] leading-[0.85] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6\\\">\\n          Smarter<br/>Verkaufen.\\n        </h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/70\\\">\\n          Wir begleiten den deutschen Mittelstand in die digitale Zukunft. LeadPilot ist das CRM, das f\303\274r Sie arbeitet \342\200\223 nicht umgekehrt.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 mb-4\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white px-10 py-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:bg-[#333]\\\">Demo Anfordern</button>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-serif italic text-2xl\\\">Wachstum auf <span class=\\\"underline underline-offset-8 decoration-1\\\">Autopilot</span></span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar Detail -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 border-l border-[#1A1A1A]/10 p-10 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-12\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[48px] font-serif italic block mb-2 leading-none\\\">01.</span>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-3\\\">Zentrales CRM</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/60\\\">B\303\274ndeln Sie alle Kundeninteraktionen an einem Ort. Keine verlorenen Daten mehr.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[48px] font-serif italic block mb-2 leading-none\\\">02.</span>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-3\\\">Smart Automation</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/60\\\">Individuelle Workflows, die Leads qualifizieren, w\303\244hrend Ihr Team sich fokussiert.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pt-10 border-t border-[#1A1A1A]/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[64px] font-black tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">+42%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]/40\\\">Conversion Steigerung</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-32 border-t border-[#1A1A1A]/10 grid grid-cols-4 items-center px-10 bg-[#F9F8F6]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Kunden</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">1.200+ KMUs</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Setup</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Innerhalb 24h</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Support</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Dach-Region</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"h-full flex items-center justify-end\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex -space-x-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-300\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-400 text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+5</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <!-- Decorative Vertical Text -->\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 origin-bottom rotate-90 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.6em] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]/20 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n    \302\251 2024 LeadPilot Technology Group \342\200\224 Berlin / Munich\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F9F8F6] text-[#1A1A1A] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative border-8 border-white box-border\\\">\\n  <!-- Navigation -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end p-10 h-24 border-b border-[#1A1A1A]/10\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic\\\">LeadPilot.</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-12 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Software</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">Features</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\">KMU-Fokus</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"border-b border-[#1A1A1A] pb-1\\\">Kontakt</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Hero -->\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-8 p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-8 font-semibold text-[#1A1A1A]/50\\\">Automatisierte Lead-Generierung</h2>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-[110px] leading-[0.85] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6\\\">\\n          Smarter<br/>Verkaufen.\\n        </h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/70\\\">\\n          Wir begleiten den deutschen Mittelstand in die digitale Zukunft. LeadPilot ist das CRM, das f\303\274r Sie arbeitet \342\200\223 nicht umgekehrt.\\n        </p>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 mb-4\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"bg-[#1A1A1A] text-white px-10 py-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hover:bg-[#333]\\\">Demo Anfordern</button>\\n        <span class=\\\"font-serif italic text-2xl\\\">Wachstum auf <span class=\\\"underline underline-offset-8 decoration-1\\\">Autopilot</span></span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar Detail -->\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-4 border-l border-[#1A1A1A]/10 p-10 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-12\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[48px] font-serif italic block mb-2 leading-none\\\">01.</span>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-3\\\">Zentrales CRM</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/60\\\">B\303\274ndeln Sie alle Kundeninteraktionen an einem Ort. Keine verlorenen Daten mehr.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[48px] font-serif italic block mb-2 leading-none\\\">02.</span>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-3\\\">Smart Automation</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#1A1A1A]/60\\\">Individuelle Workflows, die Leads qualifizieren, w\303\244hrend Ihr Team sich fokussiert.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"pt-10 border-t border-[#1A1A1A]/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[64px] font-black tracking-tighter leading-none\\\">+42%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]/40\\\">Conversion Steigerung</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-32 border-t border-[#1A1A1A]/10 grid grid-cols-4 items-center px-10 bg-[#F9F8F6]\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Kunden</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">1.200+ KMUs</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Setup</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Innerhalb 24h</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"border-r border-[#1A1A1A]/10 h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-8\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#1A1A1A]/50 mb-1\\\">Support</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Dach-Region</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"h-full flex items-center justify-end\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex -space-x-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-200\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-300\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-400 text-[10px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+5</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <!-- Decorative Vertical Text -->\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 origin-bottom rotate-90 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.6em] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]/20 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n    \302\251 2024 LeadPilot Technology Group \342\200\224 Berlin / Munich\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
