  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Key Metrics Visuals**\n\nI\'m now focused on the implementation details for the `KeyMetrics.tsx` component. The plan is to leverage `recharts` for KPI visualizations, opting for simple bar or line charts to maintain clarity. I\'m prioritizing an \"Editorial Aesthetic\" in the styling to ensure visual consistency with the existing design language.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Style**\n\nI\'m now integrating the detailed style guide into the component. I\'m targeting a clean, high-contrast aesthetic with a `#F9F8F6` or white background, `#1A1A1A` text, and subtle borders. I\'m focusing on typography, particularly the `font-serif`, uppercase, and specific text sizes for a consistent editorial feel. I\'ve also added the beginning of the `KeyMetrics.tsx` component, including placeholder data and example `recharts` graphs that I can begin styling.\n\n\n**Analyzing Headline Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now diving into headline styling, aiming for a clean yet impactful look. I\'m focusing on text weights, sizes, and spacing for strong visual hierarchy. I\'m taking inspiration from the German headline, especially the \"Messbarer Erfolg\" section. I am working on how to integrate the serif font with uppercase text to achieve an editorial feel.\n\n\n**Implementing Chart Visualization**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating a specific bar chart using `recharts` for the conversion data. I\'m focusing on customizing the `CartesianGrid`, axes, and tooltip for a sleek, dark aesthetic. I\'ve set the background to black, using `#1A1A1A`, and white text, along with reduced opacity on the grid for a minimalist look. I\'ve got the chart working, and am focusing on how it feels in the overall design.\n\n\n**Refining Lead Response Time**\n\nI\'m now integrating a line chart for \"Time-to-Contact\". I\'m using `recharts`\' `LineChart`, aiming for a sleek, dark aesthetic. I\'ve set the background to white with the border color `#1A1A1A/10`. I\'m incorporating a custom tooltip with a dark background and white text. I\'m focusing on the x-axis and y-axis styles for visual consistency with the existing design language.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 13
      nanos: 878149415
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
