    thinking: "**Developing the Case Study**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a \"Case Study\" component, aiming to showcase an automated sales pipeline success story. The user wants the existing serif typography (`font-serif italic`) for the headings. My next step will be to create the framework for this new component at `/`.\n\n\n**Refining the Case Study**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the `CaseStudy.tsx` component. I\'ve decided on the structure and content based on a B2B Maschinenbau company\'s success with automation, including a title and a blockquote summarizing the key points and results, like a 22% conversion increase. I\'m using a 12-column grid layout with metrics and a central quote, adhering to an Editorial Aesthetic.\n\n\n**Structuring the Case Study**\n\nI\'ve just added the main structure and heading, including the \"Case Study\" label, to the `CaseStudy.tsx` component. The heading uses a specific typeface (serif, italic), and I have included a subheading with a translation (\"Scaling through structure.\") The main component is taking shape, and I have added a border and a 2-column grid. I will need to iterate on the content.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Impact Metrics**\n\nI\'m now focusing on quantifiable results for the case study. I\'ve included specific metrics in the component, like an 85% reduction in response time (Reaktionszeit) and a win-rate figure. I\'m exploring how to present these metrics visually and clearly within the editorial framework. I\'m also including a customer quote for context.\n\n\n**Adding the Testimonial**\n\nI\'m now integrating a customer testimonial into the case study. I\'ve added a quote from Thomas Weber, Head of Sales at Maschinenbau M\303\274ller GmbH, emphasizing the automation\'s impact on opportunity handling. I\'m also including his title and a link to the full story, aiming to present this element within the existing editorial framework. I\'m aiming to add `CaseStudy.tsx` to `src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 9
      nanos: 578731362
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
