    thinking: "**Designing Client Voices**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a \"Client Voices\" section using a horizontal slider. The plan is to use `framer-motion` for the slider\'s animation and keep the existing serif editorial aesthetic. I\'ll create `/src/components/ClientVoices.tsx` and integrate it with `/src/App.tsx`. Next on the agenda is the integration of testimonial data.\n\n\n**Refining Testimonial Display**\n\nI\'m leaning towards a drag-based slider or simple next/previous buttons for the testimonial display, to maintain a smooth, minimalist look consistent with the editorial aesthetic. I\'ve started building `ClientVoices.tsx` and am integrating `framer-motion` for smooth sliding with buttons. I will soon integrate the testimonial data and finalize the functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing Testimonial Display**\n\nI\'ve got the testimonial data structured and have started implementing the logic to display them. I\'m using `useState` to manage the current index for the testimonials, and I\'ve created `next` and `prev` functions to cycle through them. Currently, I\'m aiming for basic button navigation, but a drag-based approach is still an option. I\'m focusing on ensuring smooth transitions between testimonials now.\n\n\n**Finalizing UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating the UI elements, specifically the navigation buttons, styling them to match the overall aesthetic. I\'ve focused on hover states and transitions for a polished user experience. I have incorporated the `ArrowLeft` component to create proper UI elements.\n\n\n**Refining Animation Transitions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the animation transitions for the testimonials. I am currently working on the directional transitions, using `motion.div`\'s `key`, `initial`, `animate`, and `exit` props. I\'ve set up transitions on the `x` axis for a smooth slide effect, and I\'m fine-tuning the `duration` and `ease` to optimize the animation. I\'m also ensuring that the content displays properly.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 13
      nanos: 721150011
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
