  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing FAQ Component**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the FAQ accordion component. Currently, I\'m at the stage of creating `src/components/FAQ.tsx` and importing framer-motion for the animations. The design calls for a clean, editorial feel with serif headings. My main focus is on the accordion interactivity to manage the expanding and collapsing states.\n\n\n**Integrating FAQ Section**\n\nI\'ve integrated the FAQ component into `src/App.tsx`, placing it between the Pricing and CTASection. I\'ve also begun populating the component with B2B-focused content examples, and the answers to the questions. Next I am drafting `FAQ.tsx`, including basic content examples.\n\n\n**Populating FAQ Content**\n\nI\'ve added three more FAQ entries: concerning GDPR compliance, integration capabilities, and contract terms. I\'m focusing on providing concise, informative answers with a B2B focus. I am now working on ensuring all questions are clear and the information is well-structured within the accordion component.\n\n\n**Refining FAQ Structure**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the visual structure, implementing a sticky sidebar for the FAQ section using framer-motion. I\'m prioritizing accessibility and ensuring smooth transitions between the questions and answers within the accordion. The goal is to create a dynamic and engaging user experience, including a clean editorial style with a sticky navigation bar to improve the user experience.\n\n\n**Developing FAQ Accordion**\n\nI\'m now implementing the FAQ accordion with framer-motion, focusing on a clean editorial style. I\'m prioritizing dynamic interaction. I\'m currently creating the component using `faqs.map` to dynamically render the content, and setting up the accordion\'s open/close functionality.\n\n\n\n**Optimizing FAQ Animations**\n\nI\'m now optimizing the FAQ accordion animations using `AnimatePresence` and `motion.div`. I\'m fine-tuning the transitions for a smooth opening/closing effect, and focusing on the `easeInOut` easing to improve the user experience. The goal is to make the interaction both visually appealing and efficient. I\'m prioritizing performance and smoothness.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 15
      nanos: 416580033
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
