        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Control image aspect ratios\"\nicon: \"aspect_ratio\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add image generation to the app and provide an affordance for the user to specify the aspect ratio (1:1, 2:3, 3:2, 3:4, 4:3, 9:16, 16:9, and 21:9). Use gemini-3.1-flash-image-preview for general cases, or gemini-3-pro-image-preview where studio-quality images are required."
