  planner_response {
    response: "I have created and integrated an interactive visual CRM dashboard with Recharts to display real-time sales pipeline conversion rates and monthly revenue projections:\n\n- **Sales Pipeline Funnel**: Visualized stage-by-stage progression (Inbound $\\rightarrow$ Erstkontakt $\\rightarrow$ Demo $\\rightarrow$ Angebot $\\rightarrow$ Closed Won) with interactive click-to-inspect stage details, step-by-step conversion percentages, volume counts, and lead source breakdowns.\n- **Monthly Revenue Projections & Forecasting**: Built a dynamic projection engine using Recharts Composed Area and Line charts comparing actual realized revenue, expected trajectories, targets, and optimistic scenarios across the year.\n- **Interactive Scenario Simulator**: Added real-time sliders for lead volume growth, conversion rate optimization, and average deal sizes, recalculating projected ARR and additional revenue deltas instantly.\n- **Live Deal Stream & Navigation**: Provided an active pipeline deal feed with automated next actions and integrated the dashboard directly into the top navigation and layout."
