    response: "I have added entrance animations to the Recharts components and surrounding dashboard elements in the `CRMDashboard`:\n\n- **Chart Element Transitions**: Enabled staggered entrance animations on all Recharts visual layers (`Bar`, `Area`, and `Line` components) with fluid `ease-out` curves, custom timing (1,300ms\342\200\2232,000ms), and staggered start delays.\n- **Viewport & Tab Reveal**: Wrapped chart containers and inspect panels in viewport-triggered motion transitions that fade and scale into view as the user scrolls to the dashboard or toggles between the Pipeline Funnel and Revenue Forecast tabs.\n- **Dynamic Key Triggering**: Added reactive container keys so adjusting time range filters or simulator sliders smoothly re-renders the charts with fluid growth transitions.\n- **KPI Bar Staggering**: Integrated sequential entrance animations for the top metric cards."
