nts the month and a \'Monatsabschluss & Prognose\' label clearly. I\'m styling the verified or AI-forecast status badge to be visually distinct. Additionally, I am styling the display of the realized actual revenue series value. I\'m using appropriate background colors and text styles to improve readability.\n\n\n**Evaluating Revenue Presentation**\n\nI\'m now focusing on displaying revenue values, incorporating actual, projected, and optimistic scenario amounts, and the target value in the forecast tooltip. I\'m formatting the values to the German locale and ensuring the layout and color-coding enhance readability, aiming for clear and concise comparisons. I\'m also ensuring the styling is applied properly.\n\n\n"
