    response: "I have enhanced the **Recharts** visualization implementation in the CRM Dashboard with custom branded tooltips:\n\n- **Sales Pipeline Funnel Tooltip (`CustomFunnelTooltip`)**:\n  - Displays the stage name, funnel phase, and conversion rate badge.\n  - Presents exact metrics for active lead count, total pipeline value (\342\202\254), average deal value per contact, and average dwell time.\n  - Features an embedded stage-efficiency progress bar, stage drop-off rate, top acquisition channel share, and an interactive click hint for the deep-dive stage inspector.\n\n- **Revenue Projection & Forecast Tooltip (`CustomForecastTooltip`)**:\n  - Automatically identifies whether a data point is historical (`Ist-Zahlen realisiert`) or forward-looking (`KI-Prognose`).\n  - Displays exact monospaced numerical figures for actual revenue, expected forecast, optimistic scenario, and quarterly budget targets with branded color indicators.\n  - Calculates and renders the exact plan variance delta (both absolute \342\202\254 and percentage deviation) against the target budget."
    modified_response: "I have enhanced the **Recharts** visualization implementation in the CRM Dashboard with custom branded tooltips:\n\n- **Sales Pipeline Funnel Tooltip (`CustomFunnelTooltip`)**:\n  - Displays the stage name, funnel phase, and conversion rate badge.\n  - Presents exact metrics for active lead count, total pipeline value (\342\202\254), average deal value per contact, and average dwell time.\n  - Features an embedded stage-efficiency progress bar, stage drop-off rate, top acquisition channel share, and an interactive click hint for the deep-dive stage inspector.\n\n- **Revenue Projection & Forecast Tooltip (`CustomForecastTooltip`)**:\n  - Automatically identifies whether a data point is historical (`Ist-Zahlen realisiert`) or forward-looking (`KI-Prognose`).\n  - Displays exact monospaced numerical figures for actual revenue, expected forecast, optimistic scenario, and quarterly budget targets with branded color indicators.\n  - Calculates and renders the exact plan variance delta (both absolute \342\202\254 and percentage deviation) against the target budget."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
