  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Icon Integration**\n\nI\'ve been exploring potential icon additions from `lucide-react`, specifically `X`, `ExternalLink`, `Filter`, `Globe`, `Mail`, `Share2`, `PhoneCall`, `Award`, `Search`, `Download`, and `ArrowRight`. I\'m now transitioning to designing the modal component\'s structure and data handling. The focus is on the look and feel, and overall functionality of the modal itself.\n\n\n**Defining Modal Triggers**\n\nI\'m now determining the precise events that will launch the detailed modal. Specifically, clicks on Funnel BarChart segments and stage buttons are clear triggers. Furthermore, I\'ve identified Forecast ComposedChart data points, and plan to include visual prompts on chart headers and within tooltips, to guide users towards modal interaction. The trigger events are becoming clearer as I delve into the user interface interactions.\n\nLet\'s look at the Lead Source Data model\n\nI\'ve sketched a `LeadSourceItem` interface in TypeScript, laying out the data model structure for the lead source information. I\'m focusing on key attributes like `sourceName`, `category`, `leadsCount`, revenue metrics, CAC, and performance status. The model includes fields for trend analysis and details like `topSalesRep` and `sampleDealCompany`.\n\n**Structuring Lead Source Data**\n\nI\'ve started building out the `LeadSourceItem` interface in TypeScript, which details the structure for the lead source data. The plan is to include essential attributes: `sourceName`, `category`, lead counts, and various revenue metrics, plus performance indicators such as status, top sales rep, and sample company information. I also intend to add fields for trend analysis.\n\n\n**Constructing Lead Source Data**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `DataPointLeadSources` interface, creating detailed datasets. I\'m building data for each pipeline stage and projection month, ensuring complete coverage. The plan incorporates smooth animations, keyboard accessibility with the escape key, and click-to-close behavior. I\'m also preparing tab filters, a search input, and high-impact metrics for effective data visualization within the modal. I\'m focusing on a clean table or card layout for detailed lead source information, including title and badges, and planning data-driven visual indicators for each lead source item.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 78782632
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
