    thinking: "**Considering Export Functionality**\n\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating an \"Export Data\" button into the CRMDashboard. The goal is to allow users to download the displayed metrics as a CSV file. It seems a similar export functionality would be beneficial for the current dashboard\'s data too, so I\'ll also add a button to export the dashboard data.\n\n\n**Analyzing Export Options**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into export functionalities, aiming for a robust system. I\'m imagining a prominent \"Export Data\" button next to \"Refresh\" in the header toolbar. Clicking it could open a modal with options like CSV exports of the current view (funnel stages, revenue forecasts) or the entire CRM dataset. A PDF report option for print-friendly output is also a consideration.\n\n\n"
