  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Year-over-Year (YoY) Comparison Toggle** in the **CRMDashboard**:\n\n- **Interactive Comparison Toggle**: Added a dedicated `YoY Vergleich` toggle button in the dashboard control bar with active visual indicators (`GitCompare` icon and live indicator badge) to dynamically show or hide historical comparative data.\n- **Funnel Stage Comparison**: Integrated secondary comparison bars (`previousYearLeads`) in the **Pipeline Funnel** chart with custom tooltips displaying delta counts and percentage growth for every pipeline stage.\n- **Forecast Trajectory Curves**: Added a secondary dashed baseline curve and area fill (`previousYear`) to the **Monthly Revenue Projections** composed chart, comparing historical 2025 revenue milestones against current actuals and AI-driven growth projections.\n- **Contextual Tooltip Breakdowns**: Extended both the Funnel and Forecast branded tooltips with YoY baseline metrics, delta variance badges, and growth percentages."
