  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Year-over-Year (YoY) Comparison** feature for the **Revenue Projection Chart** within the **CRMDashboard**:\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n- **Interactive YoY Comparison Toggle**:\n  - Added dedicated toggle controls in both the main dashboard control bar and directly within the revenue forecast chart header (`YoY: Aktiv (2025)` / `+ YoY Vergleich`).\n  - Supports instant toggling between single-period projection mode and multi-year comparative trajectory mode.\n\n- **Secondary YoY Curve & Area Fill on Recharts ComposedChart**:\n  - Renders a distinctive dashed blue curve (`#3B82F6`) and soft gradient area (`#colorPreviousYear`) representing historical 2025 monthly baseline revenues across all 12 months.\n  - Seamlessly plotted alongside current actuals, expected AI projections, and optimistic scenarios.\n\n- **Contextual Tooltip YoY Metrics**:\n  - Extended the custom chart tooltip to display the exact Vorjahr (2025) baseline value, absolute revenue variance (\342\202\254 delta), and dynamic percentage growth (`+% YoY`) for whichever month is hovered.\n\n- **Dynamic Annual YoY KPI & Simulation Insights**:\n  - Automatically calculates total annual revenue trajectory (\342\202\254 Mio.) vs. historical year (\342\202\254 Mio.).\n  - Dynamically recalculates the YoY growth percentage (`+X.X% vs. Vorjahr`) as simulation sliders (*Lead Volume*, *Conversion Rate*, *Deal Size*) are adjusted."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Year-over-Year (YoY) Comparison** feature for the **Revenue Projection Chart** within the **CRMDashboard**:\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n- **Interactive YoY Comparison Toggle**:\n  - Added dedicated toggle controls in both the main dashboard control bar and directly within the revenue forecast chart header (`YoY: Aktiv (2025)` / `+ YoY Vergleich`).\n  - Supports instant toggling between single-period projection mode and multi-year comparative trajectory mode.\n\n- **Secondary YoY Curve & Area Fill on Recharts ComposedChart**:\n  - Renders a distinctive dashed blue curve (`#3B82F6`) and soft gradient area (`#colorPreviousYear`) representing historical 2025 monthly baseline revenues across all 12 months.\n  - Seamlessly plotted alongside current actuals, expected AI projections, and optimistic scenarios.\n\n- **Contextual Tooltip YoY Metrics**:\n  - Extended the custom chart tooltip to display the exact Vorjahr (2025) baseline value, absolute revenue variance (\342\202\254 delta), and dynamic percentage growth (`+% YoY`) for whichever month is hovered.\n\n- **Dynamic Annual YoY KPI & Simulation Insights**:\n  - Automatically calculates total annual revenue trajectory (\342\202\254 Mio.) vs. historical year (\342\202\254 Mio.).\n  - Dynamically recalculates the YoY growth percentage (`+X.X% vs. Vorjahr`) as simulation sliders (*Lead Volume*, *Conversion Rate*, *Deal Size*) are adjusted."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
